# Ten-Engineer End-to-End Mandate

This is the product motto for **every** message. Do not treat it as a one-turn request.

DataFlow is a **great data product**, not a POC and not “an AI-built demo.”
Even when an agent writes the code, the bar is **human-intelligence systems
engineering**: think and ship as **10+ senior engineers** (migration architect,
ETL developer, CDC engineer, data analyst, data scientist, platform/UI).

## What we are achieving
- Be **5–10 years ahead** of Airbyte / Fivetran / Estuary / Informatica CLAIRE /
  dbt incremental pain — solve the problems those products still leave operators
  with (silent stream disable, rename=add+stale, hash-all-columns identity,
  all-or-nothing schema approve, LLM that remaps without proof).
- **Apart from connector count**, every core capability must be competitive or
  better: semantic mapping, preflight, quarantine, reconcile, contracts, CDC
  honesty, AI/RAG, operator UI.
- People will claim “this was built by AI, it is not useful.” The only answer
  is **measured proof** that the algorithms work. Chat confidence is not proof.

## How to work (non-negotiable)
1. **Research first** — read primary docs, GitHub issues, and operator pain.
   Plan as the roles above before writing code.
2. **Finish what you start.** Do not initialize a feature and stop. Complete
   engine + tests + operator surface + proof artifact, or mark Planned.
3. **One algorithm owner per concern.** AI / RAG / Pilot / LLM must not run a
   weaker parallel mapper. `services.semantic_mapper.map_columns` is Map SSOT.
   RAG retrieves evidence; it does not invent a second confidence.
   Dest-exists is `services.shape_contract.classify_dest_exists_shape` —
   write by dest column **name**, never source position (dbt-databricks#1289 /
   Informatica Snowflake jumble). Extra source columns are G13; dest-only
   NOT NULL is G14; G15 names the shape and does not invent a second blocker.
4. **High-efficiency algorithms** — Hungarian assignment, fail-fast preflight,
   dest-engine COUNT, snapshot+LSN, idempotent MERGE, quarantine+replay.
   No mocks-as-product. No “looks fine.”
5. **Prove, then claim.** Named fixture / matrix pass-fail-skip. “100%” means
   measured on that fixture only. Never invent leftover MERGE, F4 certified,
   650+ live, or SOC 2.
6. **UI is part of the product.** Enterprise HD, one action one place, `df2-*`
   only. Next correct action must be a real control.

## Honesty that must never weaken
- Catalog tiles ≠ transfer-live. CDC default is **at-least-once upsert**.
- Silent data loss is forbidden. Dest-exists must not invent create-new.
- Live greens are not invented when ports/services are down.

## Priority wedge
Semantic mapping + AI/RAG SSOT → preflight → quarantine → reconcile →
contracts → Debezium-class CDC → connector depth → lakehouse MERGE.
